## 3. Key Terms

| English Term | 中文解释 | Exam-style meaning |
|---|---|---|
| Accessor | 访问器 | A method that returns the value of a private attribute |
| Getter | getter 方法 | Common name for an accessor method |
| Mutator | 修改器 | A method that changes the value of a private attribute |
| Setter | setter 方法 | Common name for a mutator method |
| Encapsulation | 封装 | Restricting direct access to data and controlling access through methods |
| Private attribute | 私有属性 | An attribute that cannot be directly accessed outside the class |
| Return value | 返回值 | A value sent back by a method |
| Validation | 验证 | Checking whether a new value is acceptable before assigning it |
| Read-only attribute | 只读属性 | An attribute that can be read but not changed from outside |
| Read-write attribute | 可读可写属性 | An attribute that can be read and changed through methods |
| Object state | 对象状态 | Current values of an object's attributes |
| Controlled access | 受控访问 | Reading or changing data through methods rather than direct access |

