## 10. Object State Trace with Setter

### Code

```java
Student s1 = new Student("Alice", 85);

s1.setMark(90);
s1.setMark(150);
s1.setMark(72);
```

### Trace Table

| Step | Action | Valid? | s1.mark |
|---:|---|---|---:|
| 1 | constructor sets 85 | yes | 85 |
| 2 | `setMark(90)` | yes | 90 |
| 3 | `setMark(150)` | no | 90 |
| 4 | `setMark(72)` | yes | 72 |

Final state:

| Object | name | mark |
|---|---|---:|
| s1 | Alice | 72 |

