## 19. Accessors, Mutators, and UML Preview

UML class diagrams often show visibility:

```text
- private
+ public
```

Example:

```text
Student
------------------------
- studentId : String
- name : String
- mark : int
------------------------
+ getStudentId() : String
+ getName() : String
+ getMark() : int
+ setName(name : String) : void
+ setMark(mark : int) : void
+ hasPassed() : boolean
```

This means:

| UML Symbol | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `-` | private |
| `+` | public |

UML will be explained in detail later.

